---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the Publication"
  description="The manifesto, testing philosophy, and editorial background of Kritrimta, an independent journal edited by Saurav Karki."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-masthead">
        <span class="mono-kicker">EDITORIAL MANIFESTO</span>
        <h1 class="about-title">About Kritrimta</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">
          <em>Kritrimta</em> (कृत्रिमता) translates to artificiality or the synthetic state. We are an independent publication examining how synthetic intelligence and silicon engineering reshape our computation, work, and culture.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-body prose">
        <h2>The Founding Thesis</h2>
        <p>
          The tech media landscape is overwhelmed by venture-backed hype, corporate keynote regurgitation, and affiliate link farms masquerading as objective reviews. 
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Kritrimta was established to operate on a different frequency:</strong> rigorous benchmarks, first-principles architectural breakdowns, and unfiltered critical commentary on machine learning systems and computing hardware.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="editorial-quote">
          "If software is eating the world, machine intelligence is re-architecting the substrate. We report on the substrate itself."
        </blockquote>

        <h2 id="editorial-policy">Our Editorial Principles</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Zero Sponsored Review Coverage:</strong> Hardware units and software subscriptions evaluated on Kritrimta are procured independently or disclosed explicitly with zero pre-publication approval from manufacturers.</li>
          <li><strong>Reproducible Benchmarks:</strong> When we test an LLM context window or GPU thermal throttle curve, we document our test methodology, prompt suites, and telemetry data.</li>
          <li><strong>Long-Horizon Perspective:</strong> We care less about daily press releases and more about architectural paradigm shifts — memory bandwidth bottlenecks, open weights sovereignty, and transformer inference economics.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>The Editor</h2>
        <div class="editor-profile-card">
          <div class="editor-avatar">S</div>
          <div class="editor-info">
            <h3>Saurav Karki</h3>
            <span class="editor-title">Editor &amp; Primary Contributor</span>
            <p>
              Saurav is a technologist and writer tracking artificial intelligence, systems programming, and high-performance hardware. He writes every issue of The Kritrimta Dispatch and oversees all benchmark suites.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Get in Touch &amp; Tips</h2>
        <p>
          Have a technical tip, benchmark anomaly, or research paper we should examine? Reach out directly via our <a href="/contact">Editorial Desk</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .about-masthead {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .mono-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .editorial-quote {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .editor-profile-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .editor-avatar {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent), #8b5cf6);
    color: #ffffff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .editor-info h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .editor-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .editor-info p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .editor-profile-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
